# ── Signing & secrets (never commit) ────────────────────────────
*.p12
*.cer
*.certSigningRequest
*.mobileprovision
*.provisionprofile
*.keychain
*.keychain-db
AuthKey_*.p8
.env
.env.*

# ── Editors & tools ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~
.claude/settings.local.json

# ── Logs & scratch ──────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
*.tmp

# ── Private references (screenshots of a real desktop) ──────────
references/

# ── Markdown: only README.md for now ────────────────────────────
# Undecided which docs to publish. Allow one later with a line like:  !docs/RELEASING.md
*.md
!/README.md
# Community files GitHub shows on the repo (contributing, conduct, security, issue/PR templates)
!/CONTRIBUTING.md
!/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
!/SECURITY.md
!/.github/**/*.md
